# EAS Build uploads the whole repository, but the phone app is built from mobile/ alone.
# Leave out everything else (the website, desktop app, Python backend, data, docs) and the folders
# the app never ships. Without this the upload was ~633 MB, almost all of it mobile/node_modules
# (EAS ignores the nested mobile/.gitignore) and the git history.
/*
!/mobile
/mobile/node_modules
/mobile/.expo
/mobile/dist
/mobile/web-build
/mobile/*.tsbuildinfo
/mobile/.env*.local
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.mobileprovision
